{"1397240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "MEGAJUMP", "steam_appid": 1397240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "What was once the most expensive game on steam by a mile is now free.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2>Escape the Pit of Despair. Jump by jump you stray closer to G̶̡̟͈͎̳͕̬̝͕̹͈̣̎̑̽̾̓̌̈́O̸͙͓͙̪͍̮̲͇̲͙̾̀̓͆̓̓̋̕͝ͅD̴̡̨̛̟̼͍̯̦̹̰̟̜̩̑͑͑̑̈́.<br>Reach G̶̡̟͈͎̳͕̬̝͕̹͈̣̎̑̽̾̓̌̈́O̸͙͓͙̪͍̮̲͇̲͙̾̀̓͆̓̓̋̕͝ͅD̴̡̨̛̟̼͍̯̦̹̰̟̜̩̑͑͑̑̈́ and À̵̡͖̝͎̖̻̤̻̜͇̘̫̈̓̈́͑̀̏́̍͑̾̇̎̕ͅŞ̸̦͍̣͑͆̃̎͝C̶̢̥̦̞̆̔Ḛ̸͔͇̩̞̗͍̈́̽̇̃̿̆̌̓͆̋͆͘͝N̷̡̧̰̞̫͙͕̟̙̝͔̞͕̰̈́̎̈͐̔̀̋̏̂̈́͑̕D̴̦̦̪̰̲͗͌͑̔̋̒̎̒͑̎̄̂̚̚. You will face many challenges along the way and meet a lot of new friends, And if you fall, just remember this. Just jump up, Just jump up.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mechanics</h2>In this precision 3D platformer you will fall a lot, but its important to remember that you just need to jump up. Every jump is a carefully through out Mega Jump which needs to be planned out according to the height and length needed for the Mega Jump.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397240/extras/8f32e9a3e6d3ec382f75e9f2d2b2bffb.poster.avif?t=1675286328\" width=600 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397240/extras/8f32e9a3e6d3ec382f75e9f2d2b2bffb.webm?t=1675286328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397240/extras/8f32e9a3e6d3ec382f75e9f2d2b2bffb.mp4?t=1675286328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The longer you <strong>charge</strong> your jump, the <strong>higher</strong> you go but you also go <strong>shorter</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397240/extras/5ae3d31b832d2b1a507686363de31a2f.poster.avif?t=1675286328\" width=600 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397240/extras/5ae3d31b832d2b1a507686363de31a2f.webm?t=1675286328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397240/extras/5ae3d31b832d2b1a507686363de31a2f.mp4?t=1675286328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Same for the opposite, <strong>charge</strong> for less and you go <strong>further</strong> but <strong>lower</strong>.<br><br>Will you Megajump to the top? or will you mega jump and fail. Megafall", "about_the_game": "What was once the most expensive game on steam by a mile is now free.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2>Escape the Pit of Despair. Jump by jump you stray closer to G̶̡̟͈͎̳͕̬̝͕̹͈̣̎̑̽̾̓̌̈́O̸͙͓͙̪͍̮̲͇̲͙̾̀̓͆̓̓̋̕͝ͅD̴̡̨̛̟̼͍̯̦̹̰̟̜̩̑͑͑̑̈́.<br>Reach G̶̡̟͈͎̳͕̬̝͕̹͈̣̎̑̽̾̓̌̈́O̸͙͓͙̪͍̮̲͇̲͙̾̀̓͆̓̓̋̕͝ͅD̴̡̨̛̟̼͍̯̦̹̰̟̜̩̑͑͑̑̈́ and À̵̡͖̝͎̖̻̤̻̜͇̘̫̈̓̈́͑̀̏́̍͑̾̇̎̕ͅŞ̸̦͍̣͑͆̃̎͝C̶̢̥̦̞̆̔Ḛ̸͔͇̩̞̗͍̈́̽̇̃̿̆̌̓͆̋͆͘͝N̷̡̧̰̞̫͙͕̟̙̝͔̞͕̰̈́̎̈͐̔̀̋̏̂̈́͑̕D̴̦̦̪̰̲͗͌͑̔̋̒̎̒͑̎̄̂̚̚. You will face many challenges along the way and meet a lot of new friends, And if you fall, just remember this. Just jump up, Just jump up.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mechanics</h2>In this precision 3D platformer you will fall a lot, but its important to remember that you just need to jump up. Every jump is a carefully through out Mega Jump which needs to be planned out according to the height and length needed for the Mega Jump.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397240/extras/8f32e9a3e6d3ec382f75e9f2d2b2bffb.poster.avif?t=1675286328\" width=600 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397240/extras/8f32e9a3e6d3ec382f75e9f2d2b2bffb.webm?t=1675286328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.st